@narrator | Keep your old journal entries. They are proof you were different. They are proof you will be different again. Do not delete them when the shame comes — the shame is the point. It means you grew. |
@narrator | Fold ace-king sometimes. Pro will tell you why. It is not about the cards. It is about knowing when a good thing is the wrong thing. That is the most expensive lesson at the table and Pro paid for it in chips. |
