@narrator | Trust the captain. Trust the crew. Trust yourself last because you are the one who needs to earn it and the earning is the work. |
@narrator | Wesley is growing. Do not tell him. He will figure it out and the figuring out is the growing and the growing is the point. |
@narrator | If you see something in the sounder that does not match the pattern say it. The pattern is not the ocean. The pattern is yesterday's ocean. Today's ocean is always new. |
